residual 1/(13(182m+1)) = the half-width of the aligned tooth => STRICTLY DECREASING => M strictly UP.

=> far-element monotonicity for the covering-MIN family is CLOSED-FORM (tooth-narrowing),
   proved without any multi-linear/Gowers input. The Gowers inverse is only invoked for the
